cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the revised manuscript and the archived code version actually used.
  This working revision has no verified version-specific code DOI yet;
  the software reference below identifies the existing archive only.
title: "ReRx: Antihypertensive medications and Parkinson's disease risk"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/TheDongLab/ReRx"
url: "https://github.com/TheDongLab/ReRx"
abstract: >-
  Research scripts supporting medication-wide screening in MGB Biobank,
  replication in AMP-PD cohorts, MarketScan target trial emulation, and
  exploratory PD brain and drug-perturbation transcriptomic analyses.
  See README.md for execution prerequisites and current limitations.
keywords:
  - Parkinson's disease
  - antihypertensive medications
  - target trial emulation
  - drug repurposing
  - transcriptomics
